# Claude Code project notes stay local
CLAUDE.md

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Large regenerable data (see CLAUDE.md section 4 for the commands), ~100 MB.
# run_main.npz and greens_run.npz stay tracked: they are what the two
# animation scripts read, and a script in the repo should run from a clone.
data/run_step_dx*.npz

# Input to the local scan scripts only; no tracked script reads or writes it.
data/scan.json

# Everything except the two animation scripts stays on disk but out of the
# repo: still-figure generators, validation, cross-checks and parameter scans.
# code/analytic.py is the exact single-slab reference that validate_greens.py
# checks the frequency-domain solver against; nothing else uses it.
code/analytic.py
scripts/make_plots.py
scripts/build_viewer.py
scripts/validate_greens.py
scripts/fig_greens_compare.py
scripts/scan.py
scripts/fig_scan.py
